    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with **Jackson Merrill** serving as our clear focal point; his 74.44 efficiency score is bolstered by a favorable matchup against Holmes, G, and a massive 13% boost from his dynamic platoon advantage. Alongside him, **Cole Carrigg** (71.23) is our strongest value play, benefiting from a 14% park factor upgrade and favorable winds that provide the ceiling we crave for our 5x5 pursuit. Both **Gunnar Henderson** and **Kyle Tucker** remain high-conviction starts, with **Gunnar Henderson** navigating a tough dynamic platoon check against Aldegheri while still providing a robust 68.65 score due to his high-leverage lineup spot.\n\nThe most difficult bench decision involved **Nolan Schanuel**, who narrowly missed the cut at 51.38. While his plate discipline usually demands a spot, he was squeezed out by the sheer efficiency of **Dominic Smith** and **Josh Jung**, the latter of whom maintains a steady 57.01 despite the park penalty. We are keeping a close eye on the status of **Coby Mayo** and **Gunnar Henderson**, both of whom remain in \"Lineup Pending\" status; should either drop out of the #2 or #5 spots, we would need to pivot to the high-OBP profile of **Nolan Schanuel** or the speed potential of **Nasim Nunez** to hedge against our scarcity requirements in the SB category. Overall, the lineup is optimized to maximize run production against middle-tier arms while maintaining the speed floor essential for this Ottoneu roster.",
